  "notes": "GAAP; basic statements from p3-4 (governmental funds, Total column). Government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1) used for balance_sheet. Receipts/disbursements from p4 (total column); gains on sale/disposal, note payment and bond payment are shown by the report under other financing sources (uses) and recorded in other_financing (net 116,130). Expenditures by fund have no function breakdown; General -> public safety, Sinking -> capital outlay, Bond -> debt service interest (all review). Detail uses the 'Actual on Budgetary Basis' column of the three budget schedules (compared to Original and Final Budget); this differs from the accrual-basis statement amounts (e.g. General expenditures 415,154 vs 417,004 on p4). Budget schedule is on a budgetary basis so sale/gain lines are within revenue there. Fund balance discrepancy in the report: see report_discrepancies. ending_cash computed from the balance sheet (checking + county treasurer). No transfers between funds. Read pages 1-7 of 7"
